## Documentation Strategy
# Exclude planning docs (business/PM docs - not needed in repo)
docs/

# Exclude development docs until production readiness (final sprint)
# Will be included in production deployment only
src/docs/

# Exclude all markdown files
*.md

# Exception: Allow critical root documentation
!README.md
!SECRETS_MANAGEMENT.md
